# Seven-Bit Blues: a Bellbeat song, our own.
# In 7/4: twenty-eight sixteenths a bar, counted two, two, three.

title  Seven-Bit Blues
blurb  Seven bits to a character, seven beats to a bar, and the blues in every one.
bpm    120
meter  7
swing  60
voice  pulse
order  intro verse verse chorus verse outro

